          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Program objectives</span></span><br>\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Explore the key features of 3D CT-based planning<br>\n </span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand intra-op surgical steps and workflow</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Summarize functional knee positioning™</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand AccuStop™ haptic guided bone prep</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Explore post-op clinical data</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
